<title>USA: Danville, Ky., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Danville, Ky., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co. said it won $9.000</p>
<p>million of Danville, Ky., Kentucky multi-City lease revenue</p>
<p>refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.68 percent.</p>
